ave:\n\\[ f(f(10)) = f(2) = 1. \\]\n\nThe final answer is:\n\\[ \\boxed{1} \\]"},"grade":{"answer":"\\boxed{1}","correct":true,"format":"boxed","parseable":true},"id":"algebra:525"}
